{"1687710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Everdine - A Lost Girl's Tale", "steam_appid": 1687710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687710/extras/609e51641181cffaa32ec43a32e42a33.poster.avif?t=1782052601\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687710/extras/609e51641181cffaa32ec43a32e42a33.webm?t=1782052601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687710/extras/609e51641181cffaa32ec43a32e42a33.mp4?t=1782052601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Everdine - A Lost Girl’s Tale</strong> is a short, atmospheric, fairy tale vibes RPG Maker horror adventure game. <br><br>Everdine finds herself lost in a forest of eternal twilight. Soon to be hunted by a mysterious beast, she will stumble across the remnants of others that came before her, and learn of a magical ritual that may be her only way out. <br><br>Gather the needed ingredients to complete the spell, and bring her home before the dangers of these woods devour poor Everdine. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687710/extras/db23d23b7cad794ed951952003f71082.poster.avif?t=1782052601\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687710/extras/db23d23b7cad794ed951952003f71082.webm?t=1782052601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short, atmospheric game.  <br></li><li>Collect the needed items to escape an environment that tries to kill you.  <br></li><li>Progression t